# Reference-only control file: scripts/package.sh (fpm-based) is the
# actual build/package path used by CI (release.yml, install-test.yml)
# and documented in scripts/package.sh's own header -- it emits a
# single generic fractalsql-mariadb_<version>_<arch>.deb, not a
# per-major package, since the UDF ABI is stable across MariaDB
# 10.6/10.11/11.4 LTS/12.2 rolling. This file is kept for maintainers
# who prefer a native dpkg-buildpackage flow instead of fpm -- it is
# not exercised by any workflow in this repo.
Package: fractalsql-mariadb
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
 libc6 (>= 2.34),
 libcurl4,
 mariadb-server
Description: Stochastic Fractal Search UDF for MariaDB
 fractalsql-mariadb registers the fractal_search() UDF, a Stochastic
 Fractal Search optimizer that returns JSON top-k matches for a query
 vector against an inline corpus, plus the full Discovery/Vector/
 Cognition/Text-to-SQL/Agency/Enterprise-activation tier surface (see
 docs/features.md). Pure-C vendored core, no LuaJIT runtime
 dependency. Compatible with MariaDB 10.6 / 10.11 / 11.4 LTS / 12.2
 rolling -- the UDF ABI has been stable across these majors. The
 bundled fractalsql-reasoning-http.so plugin (Cognition/Text-to-SQL/
 Vectorizer/Agency tiers) dynamically links libcurl at runtime, hence
 the libcurl4 dependency above.
